  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#67acda\">RC Shaders - 真實工藝光影</span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#67acda\">RC Shaders</span> 是一款專為《Minecraft: Java Edition》打造的著色器包。它能為你的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>世界</strong></span>帶來<span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>明亮</strong></span>、<span style=\"color:#ff5b5b\"><strong>鮮豔</strong></span>及<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>多彩</strong></span>的視覺效果，讓一切呈現出<strong><span style=\"color:#ff5b5b\">柔和如漿果般的甜美光澤</span></strong>。此著色器具備即時<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>陰影</strong></span>、<span style=\"color:#f36931\"><strong>溫暖體積光</strong></span>、<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>環境遮蔽</strong></span>、<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>泛光</strong></span>、可自訂的<span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>雲朵</strong></span>與<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">水域</span></strong>，以及內建的抗鋸齒功能。你還可以加入額外效果，如<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">景深</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"color:#67acda\">動態模糊</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"color:#ff9ecf\">高光</span></strong>、<strong>法線貼圖</strong>、<strong>卡通渲染</strong>、<strong>世界曲率</strong>等，讓你的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>世界</strong></span>更顯<strong><span style=\"color:#ff9ecf\">魔幻</span></strong>。</p>",
